title: Hedda
act: Survey
location: Inn
quest: recipe
when: $act == Act.Survey
when: $quest_recipe == QuestState.NotStarted
---
Hedda: Welcome to the Drowned Bell. Hedda Brune. You'll be the map maker the whole valley is talking about. #line:Hedda.de92aedd_0100_Hedda
Hedda: The bell? It's at the bottom of the well in my cellar. Fell in a hundred years ago, and the inn kept the name. #line:Hedda.de92aedd_0200_Hedda
Hedda: And while you're here, you haven't seen a little brass box, have you? My mother's recipe for the fair cake is in it. #line:Hedda.de92aedd_0300_Hedda
Hedda: I had it in the cellar last autumn, and now I can't find it anywhere. #line:Hedda.de92aedd_0400_Hedda
-> I will look for it. #line:Hedda.de92aedd_0500
    Hedda: Bless you. If it's anywhere, it's down there among the barrels. #line:Hedda.de92aedd_0600_Hedda
    <<set $quest_recipe to QuestState.Active>>
-> I am here for the map. #line:Hedda.de92aedd_0700
    Hedda: Of course. Maps first, cakes after. #line:Hedda.de92aedd_0800_Hedda
    <<set $quest_recipe to QuestState.Offered>>
<<quest_changed recipe>>
===

title: Hedda
act: All
location: Inn
quest: recipe
when: has_item("recipe")
when: $quest_recipe == QuestState.Active
---
Hedda: My mother's box! Where was it? #line:Hedda.35ed47c9_0100_Hedda
Hedda: Behind the barrels. Of course it was. I'll make the cake for the fair, and you'll have the first slice. #line:Hedda.35ed47c9_0200_Hedda
<<take recipe>>
<<set $quest_recipe to QuestState.Succeeded>>
<<quest_changed recipe>>
===

title: CellarStairs
act: All
location: Inn
scenario: The commission
when: not $cellar_allowed
---
// The dialogue goes on while the cellar loads: Hedda walks to the stairs, the cartographer goes down, and she calls
// after them from the inn above.
Hedda: That's my cellar. Nobody goes down there without me. #line:CellarStairs.635224e9_0100_Hedda
-> Could you show me the cellar? The old well is a landmark. #line:CellarStairs.635224e9_0200
    Hedda: The well? Nobody has measured that since my grandfather. Come on, then. #line:CellarStairs.635224e9_0300_Hedda
    <<set $cellar_allowed to true>>
    <<walk Hedda CellarStairs>>
    <<go CellarStairs>>
    Hedda: Mind the third step! It moves. #line:CellarStairs.635224e9_0400_Hedda
    Hedda: And don't touch the wine. #line:CellarStairs.635224e9_0500_Hedda
-> Never mind. #line:CellarStairs.635224e9_0600
===

title: Well
act: All
location: Cellar
quest: survey
---
<<if surveyed("well")>>
    The well is on your map. Far down, something gleams. The drowned bell, maybe. #line:Well_0100
<<else>>
    An old well in the middle of the cellar, older than the inn. You drop a line to measure it, and set it down. #line:Well_0200
    <<survey well>>
    <<detour SurveyCheck>>
<<endif>>
===

title: RecipeBox
act: All
location: Cellar
quest: recipe
when: not $recipe_found
---
<<if $quest_recipe == QuestState.Active or $quest_recipe == QuestState.Offered>>
    Behind the barrels, a little brass box. Inside, a card in faded ink. Hedda's mother's recipe. #line:RecipeBox.8111df5f_0100
    <<give recipe>>
    <<set $recipe_found to true>>
    <<if $quest_recipe == QuestState.Offered>>
        <<set $quest_recipe to QuestState.Active>>
        <<quest_changed recipe>>
    <<endif>>
<<else>>
    A little brass box behind the barrels. It isn't yours. #line:RecipeBox.8111df5f_0200
<<endif>>
===

title: Hollyroot
act: All
location: Cellar
quest: herbs
when: not $hollyroot_taken
---
<<if $quest_herbs == QuestState.Active>>
    Hollyroot grows pale in the dark, between the stones of the wall. You cut a piece. #line:Hollyroot.8c89c126_0100
    <<give hollyroot>>
    <<set $hollyroot_taken to true>>
<<else>>
    Something pale grows between the stones of the wall. #line:Hollyroot.8c89c126_0200
<<endif>>
===
